---
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<section id="about" class="section">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto space-y-16">
    <div class="max-w-2xl reveal">
      <span class="pill mb-6" data-i18n="about.pill">About</span>
      <h2 class="type-display" style="color: var(--text);" data-i18n="about.title">Why hire a freelance backend developer?</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 reveal">
      <div class="flat-card space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="pill" data-i18n="about.problem.pill">The Problem</span>
        </div>
        <p class="type-body" data-i18n="about.problem.1">Hiring a full-time backend engineer is expensive and slow. Your API is sluggish. Your microservices are tangled. Your cloud bill keeps climbing.</p>
        <p class="type-body" data-i18n="about.problem.2">You need someone who can step in, understand the system fast, and ship fixes, not someone who needs six months to ramp up.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flat-card space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="pill pill-accent" data-i18n="about.solution.pill">The Solution</span>
        </div>
        <p class="type-body" data-i18n-html="about.solution.1">I'm {site.firstName}, a freelance backend developer who has spent 10+ years building and scaling systems in Go and Python. I've shipped microservices for SaaS platforms, built REST and GraphQL APIs, and configured cloud infrastructure.</p>
        <p class="type-body" data-i18n="about.solution.2">Whether you need a new API built from scratch, a legacy system migrated, or DevOps pipelines set up, I can start within days.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal">
      <h3 class="type-heading mb-8" data-i18n="about.how">How it works</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        {[
          { num: '01', key: 'step1' },
          { num: '02', key: 'step2' },
          { num: '03', key: 'step3' },
        ].map((step) => (
          <div class="flat-card">
            <span class="text-4xl font-bold" style="color: var(--text-muted); opacity: 0.3;">{step.num}</span>
            <h4 class="font-semibold mt-3 mb-2" style="color: var(--text);" data-i18n={`about.${step.key}.title`}>Discovery call</h4>
            <p class="type-small" data-i18n={`about.${step.key}.desc`}>We discuss your project, tech stack, and goals. I assess feasibility and suggest the best approach.</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
